   <indicator aggregation-status="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of farmers or cooperatives and agricultural MSMEs with access to new or improved storage facilities</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaggregated by sex and age when relevant. FAO states that storage means the phase of the postharvest system during which the products are kept in such a way as to guarantee food security other than during periods of agricultural production. Harvest storage systems are systems that facilitate storage of harvested produce.</narrative>
    </description>
